  "initialFailure": "All96 domain cases and two raw adapter cases passed. Two JSON fixture cases called Jackson JsonNode.map (which maps the node itself) instead of iterating array children. Both actual Synapse cases passed creation/admission/key checks but retained a pre-restart HTTP configuration after the owned container changed its mapped port. Corrected only the two test files: explicit child iteration and reacquisition of the current fixture endpoint without replacing provider identity/keys. Production code was unchanged. The final six data cases and quality checks passed; unchanged96 domain cases were not rerun.",
