  "evidence": [
    "Separate group request/marker/observation types preserve explicit canonical Matrix users from different historical companies or fresh organization identities; no space-to-company alias or peer identity derivation.",
    "Stable hrisg_dm alias and immutable org.hris.space_conversation creation marker, version12/private/nonfederated/Megolm/invited history/forbidden guests and restricted direct power settings; only exact canonical participants accepted.",
    "Pure assessment permits only absent initial settings or invite on an otherwise matching candidate. Foreign audience, identity/marker/server, conflicting state, tombstones, other creators and invalid membership are rejected.",
    "Raw acquisition and room-ID/state mapping share safe provider failure handling; invalid requests fail before I/O, malformed/duplicate/oversized state fails, and cancellation/interruption propagates. No hidden retry or repository-to-repository call.",
    "Actual Synapse creates a group room for retained users from different companies before peer login, admits peer join, retains both original signed key sets and same alias/state through restart, and never creates the corresponding company alias.",
    "A lost response after actual successful creation is recovered through the same alias; duplicate create returns AliasInUse. Direct fixture injection of a foreign invite is rejected before and after restart without replacing the room. Only owned providers/resources are stopped."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "These provider-control and public-key checks are not SDK encrypted-message or Mobile group-adoption acceptance. No room content, delivery status, offline recipient claim or capability is granted by provider creation alone.",
    "No DI, endpoint or schema changed; actual API/full-worker evidence remains accepted from b478f776 and was not repeated. Next add group-owned request/queue/publication and original-room adoption with current admission before/after bounded provider work.",
    "Generic background_jobs still requires company_id. Never supply a space as company. Exact canonical participants and original provenance must precede room grants, recipient key query/claim/to-device, content/sync/push and Mobile adoption.",
    "Group disabled, all54 acceptance groups open. Main1fb7fe77/Mobile33eb35b2/hosted0b804cb2, normal phone28/live8b40/schema116 pushON/SMTPOFF and Starter9959c1d unchanged. No product APK, phone interaction or live rollout."
  ]
